      "post_id": "83696",
      "author_handle": "NHSChoices",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 16 years 5 months ago",
      "body": "Hi Ladies,\nWe are contacting women who are either looking to or currently breastfeeding their babies in view of becoming potential case studies for NHS Choices.  This could involve us following you at intervals throughout your breastfeeding experience, getting updates in the form of blogs, occasional diary updates recording your thoughts and feelings as well as potentially being available for media use.  We would also monitor your experience of using our new and innovative breastfeeding planner.\nWe are interested in hearing from both first time mothers as well as experienced mothers, but all women will be considered, especially if you are/were nervous about breastfeeding.\nPlease feel free to contact me either by e-mail on krystle.downie@dh.gsi.gov.uk or give me a call on 020 7972 5675. Look forward to hearing from you",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-9171/#83696",
